%% Motion — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid. No Markdown fence.

flowchart TD
    trigger([Adding a transition or animation]) --> never{Is it one of the<br/>NEVER-ANIMATE cases?}

    never -->|"validation error · destructive confirm<br/>· blocking input · moves a committed tap target"| stop[🔴 Do not animate it.<br/>Show it instantly.<br/>Moving a committed tap target is a BUG]
    never -->|no| tool{Which tool?}

    tool -->|"exit animation<br/>layout / shared element<br/>gesture"| js[motion v12 — import from motion/react]
    tool -->|route change| vt[View Transitions API]
    tool -->|everything else| css[CSS transition or animation.<br/>A library here is ~30KB<br/>doing what 2 lines of CSS do]

    js --> tokens
    vt --> tokens
    css --> tokens

    tokens[Use the SHARED tokens:<br/>--ease-standard/enter/exit<br/>--duration-instant/quick/moderate]

    tokens --> budget{Duration ≤ 600ms?<br/>and ≤ 350ms for an interaction?}
    budget -->|no| trim[Cut it. Past ~350ms<br/>an interaction feels like waiting]
    trim --> budget

    budget -->|yes| props{Animating ONLY<br/>transform and opacity?}
    props -->|"no — height, top, width, box-shadow"| swap[Substitute:<br/>height → grid-template-rows or scaleY<br/>top → translate<br/>box-shadow → cross-fade a pseudo-element]
    swap --> props

    props -->|yes| reduced{prefers-reduced-motion<br/>handled FOR THIS PATTERN?}
    reduced -->|"no, or 'all animation off'"| perpattern[Neutralise MOVEMENT, keep opacity.<br/>Never remove all feedback —<br/>the user loses confirmation<br/>that anything happened]
    perpattern --> reduced

    reduced -->|yes| restraint{Restraint check:<br/>hero / boundary / empty state / state change<br/>— or every card in a list?}
    restraint -->|"every card"| cut[Remove it. A list where all 12 items<br/>animate in reads as SLOW, not designed]
    cut --> restraint

    restraint -->|"targeted"| done([Done: one language, bounded,<br/>usable with reduced motion])

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef stopnode fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class never,tool,budget,props,reduced,restraint gate
    class trigger,done terminal
    class stop stopnode
